             body="Seif: are you around later?",
             # Deliberately not called "Reply": that word belongs to the real
             # inline reply, which only appears when the phone offers a reply
             # channel (see the reply scene, which sets one up). A demo button
             # that looks like it and merely closes the card reads as the
             # feature being broken.
             #
             # And only one action, not two: "Mute chat" was the second, which
             # is a worse version of snoozing the source - offering it here
             # invites the comparison and loses it.
             actions=["read=Mark as read"]),
